{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-13-17","kind":"proposition","title":"作内接于球的正十二面体","englishTitle":"To construct a dodecahedron and comprehend it in a sphere, like the aforesaid figures, and to prove that the side of the dodecahedron is the irrational straight line called apotome.","book":13,"number":17,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:13.prop.17","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:13.prop.17/","group":"prop","sourceNumber":17,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":null}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-13-17@raw-c07f2b66e7ce3389","contentId":"euclid-13-17","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"c07f2b66e7ce33895036a48ade6a65b2403aaa76cd80793c7e5f4440b33230d3","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-13-17.statement","euclid-13-17.construction.1","euclid-13-17.proof.1","euclid-13-17.construction.2","euclid-13-17.proof.2","euclid-13-17.proof.3","euclid-13-17.proof.4","euclid-13-17.proof.5","euclid-13-17.proof.6","euclid-13-17.proof.7","euclid-13-17.proof.8","euclid-13-17.proof.9","euclid-13-17.construction.3","euclid-13-17.proof.10","euclid-13-17.proof.11","euclid-13-17.proof.12","euclid-13-17.proof.13","euclid-13-17.proof.14","euclid-13-17.proof.15","euclid-13-17.proof.16","euclid-13-17.proof.17","euclid-13-17.proof.18","euclid-13-17.proof.19","euclid-13-17.proof.20","euclid-13-17.proof.21","euclid-13-17.proof.22","euclid-13-17.proof.23","euclid-13-17.proof.24","euclid-13-17.proof.25","euclid-13-17.construction.4","euclid-13-17.construction.5","euclid-13-17.construction.6","euclid-13-17.proof.26","euclid-13-17.proof.27","euclid-13-17.proof.28","euclid-13-17.proof.29","euclid-13-17.proof.30","euclid-13-17.proof.31","euclid-13-17.proof.32","euclid-13-17.proof.33","euclid-13-17.proof.34","euclid-13-17.proof.35","euclid-13-17.proof.36","euclid-13-17.proof.37","euclid-13-17.proof.38","euclid-13-17.proof.39","euclid-13-17.proof.40","euclid-13-17.proof.41","euclid-13-17.conclusion","euclid-13-17.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-13-17.statement","contentId":"euclid-13-17","revisionId":"euclid-13-17@raw-c07f2b66e7ce3389","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"4e5dda236b3bc95b4f33f5b18482bf7d35524ff5d7680272afdf1fadf5d84985","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"To construct a dodecahedron and comprehend it in a sphere, like the aforesaid figures, and to prove that the side of the dodecahedron is the irrational straight line called apotome."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"建造一个十二面体, 并把它理解在一个球体上, 像上述数字, 并证明十二面体的侧面是无理线段 称为 截差无理线段 。"}]},{"id":"euclid-13-17.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-13-17","revisionId":"euclid-13-17@raw-c07f2b66e7ce3389","order":1,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"f1ed72831ebb0e903fd10954139468a94a1c8bb9169feb9d48a8cb419ce20ea1","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let ABCD, CBEF, two planes of the aforesaid cube at right angles to one another, be set out, let the sides AB, BC, CD, DA, EF, EB, FC be bisected at G, H, K, L, M, N, O respectively, let GK, HL, MH, NO be joined, let the straight lines NP, PO, HQ be cut in extreme and mean ratio at the points R, S, T respectively, and let RP, PS, TQ be their greater segments; from the points R, S, T let RU, SV, TW be set up at right angles to the planes of the cube towards the outside of the cube, let them be made equal to RP, PS, TQ, and let UB, BW, WC, CV, VU be joined."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"将上述方块中的ABCD、CBEF、2 平面个在直角个之间排列,将两侧的AB、BC、CD、DA、EF、EB、FC分别分为G、H、K、L、M、N、O、GK、HL、MH、NO连接,将直线NP、PO、HQ分别划在R、S、T点,将RP、PS、TQ部分划在黄金分割个点;从R、S、T,RU、SV、TW 设置在直角到平面方块向立方体外侧, 使其等于RP、PS、TQ, 并让UB、BW、WC、CV、VU连接。"}]},{"id":"euclid-13-17.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-13-17","revisionId":"euclid-13-17@raw-c07f2b66e7ce3389","order":2,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"264fba940ee9513e71fbc499a4557340bc7029180de456527d31ce51f3e83eaf","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"I say that the pentagon UBWCV is equilateral, and in one plane, and is further equiangular."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"我说五角UBWCV是等边的, 在平面, 并且是进一步的角形。"}]},{"id":"euclid-13-17.construction.2","contentId":"euclid-13-17","revisionId":"euclid-13-17@raw-c07f2b66e7ce3389","order":3,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"faef0595fab17fb6ee549824c311eabb7fa4c25aea4139d7f6392b89284eb38c","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For let RB, SB, VB be joined."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"RB,SB,VB连接。"}]},{"id":"euclid-13-17.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-13-17","revisionId":"euclid-13-17@raw-c07f2b66e7ce3389","order":4,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"065e3f1fe6d4ff51efe0ea62ed35010e72256e209f42ecba01640284bfde3da0","citations":["euclid-13-4"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Then, since the straight line NP has been cut in extreme and mean ratio at R, and RP is the greater segment, therefore the squares on PN, NR are triple of the square on RP. [[XIII. 4](/principles/euclid-13-4)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"其后,由于直线NP线在黄金分割线R线被削减,RP线是较大的数量部分,因此,PN线正方形NR线是正方形RP线的三倍。 [[XIII. 4](/principles/euclid-13-4)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-13-17.proof.3","contentId":"euclid-13-17","revisionId":"euclid-13-17@raw-c07f2b66e7ce3389","order":5,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"8e82612754c69341c73f2c407a2d3a0a59d7f69962132059b6e0c8e8d7ea7594","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But PN is equal to NB, and PR to RU; therefore the squares on BN, NR are triple of the square on RU."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但PN等于NB,PR至RU;因此,BN的正方形是RU的正方形的三倍。（相关点与线段：NR）"}]},{"id":"euclid-13-17.proof.4","contentId":"euclid-13-17","revisionId":"euclid-13-17@raw-c07f2b66e7ce3389","order":6,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"509be0237744553747e14c0808d247a86bb47b78723c84f9b621e52bb408cf65","citations":["euclid-1-47"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But the square on BR is equal to the squares on BN, NR; [[I. 47](/principles/euclid-1-47)] therefore the square on BR is triple of the square on RU; hence the squares on BR, RU are quadruple of the square on RU."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但是,BR对BR等于BN对NR对正方形;因此,BR对BR是正方形对RU的三倍;因此,BR对BR对正方形对RU是正方形对93的三倍。 [[I. 47](/principles/euclid-1-47)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-13-17.proof.5","contentId":"euclid-13-17","revisionId":"euclid-13-17@raw-c07f2b66e7ce3389","order":7,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 5","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"ca3b93af2955f853d7228e721e85ee4adbb4534cb3a3609ea9303f005060bf9d","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But the square on BU is equal to the squares on BR, RU; therefore the square on BU is quadruple of the square on RU; therefore BU is double of RU."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但是,BU的正方形等于BR、RU的正方形;因此,BU的正方形是RU的正方形的三倍;因此,BU的RU是BU的两倍。"}]},{"id":"euclid-13-17.proof.6","contentId":"euclid-13-17","revisionId":"euclid-13-17@raw-c07f2b66e7ce3389","order":8,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 6","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"4dd62cf169d3f368366ddbb4a621fe89bbae2808ea625a1923b9b98c8c91510f","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But VU is also double of UR, inasmuch as SR is also double of PR, that is, of RU; therefore BU is equal to UV."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但VU也是UR的两倍,因为SR也是PR的两倍,即RU;因此,BU等于UV。"}]},{"id":"euclid-13-17.proof.7","contentId":"euclid-13-17","revisionId":"euclid-13-17@raw-c07f2b66e7ce3389","order":9,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 7","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"4c7480ea02b2d754875e18586e477bd1fb3fb4b324cd3e565ce81c07a7f4833a","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Similarly it can be proved that each of the straight lines BW, WC, CV is also equal to each of the straight lines BU, UV."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"同样,可以证明,BW、WC、CV直线的每一个也等于BU、UV直线的每一个直线。"}]},{"id":"euclid-13-17.proof.8","contentId":"euclid-13-17","revisionId":"euclid-13-17@raw-c07f2b66e7ce3389","order":10,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 8","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"498e1530daeb0264fc12e1dd684141951ea019aaa1c25aba758014a438815264","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore the pentagon BUVCW is equilateral."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此五角形BUVCW是等边形"}]},{"id":"euclid-13-17.proof.9","contentId":"euclid-13-17","revisionId":"euclid-13-17@raw-c07f2b66e7ce3389","order":11,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 9","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"1d6629f5c794a3f6f6eeafa5936a6e7d65ffb28b1cb49a3c046c54764fce5518","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"I say next that it is also in one plane."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"我接下来说,它也是在平面。"}]},{"id":"euclid-13-17.construction.3","contentId":"euclid-13-17","revisionId":"euclid-13-17@raw-c07f2b66e7ce3389","order":12,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"10d9cbafcfb09fcbd869a5e396c0a140b626473c36e84205a302f171697d0329","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For let PX be drawn from P parallel to each of the straight lines RU, SV and towards the outside of the cube, and let XH, HW be joined; I say that XHW is a straight line."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"PX线从P线上划出,与RU线平行,SV线线与立方体外线平行,XH线连接,HW线连接,我说XHW线是一条直线。"}]},{"id":"euclid-13-17.proof.10","contentId":"euclid-13-17","revisionId":"euclid-13-17@raw-c07f2b66e7ce3389","order":13,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 10","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"8950c79fa9b146259b36bb285ea2acc8e4e41ead98dac2917f7e330e02281e66","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For, since HQ has been cut in extreme and mean ratio at T, and QT is its greater segment, therefore, as HQ is to QT, so is QT to TH."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因为黄金分割削减了HQ,为T,QT是较大的部分,因此,HQ与QT的比例等于QT与TH的比例；HQ 与 QT 之比等于 QT 与 TH 之比。"}]},{"id":"euclid-13-17.proof.11","contentId":"euclid-13-17","revisionId":"euclid-13-17@raw-c07f2b66e7ce3389","order":14,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 11","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"5d8f5cc7f2e4e4985a40cdd3f0c451070c062cced401ac1e3af24145c67dd4b3","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But HQ is equal to HP, and QT to each of the straight lines TW, PX; therefore, as HP is to PX, so is WT to TH."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但HQ等于HP,QT等于TW,PX直线的每条QT;因此,HP对PX的比等于WT对TH的比；HP 与 PX 之比等于 WT 与 TH 之比。"}]},{"id":"euclid-13-17.proof.12","contentId":"euclid-13-17","revisionId":"euclid-13-17@raw-c07f2b66e7ce3389","order":15,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 12","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"eb2a7a43dedca3945fec5394d8a754ca6fe4a79b9b9f19cc2ad71921c538095d","citations":["euclid-11-6"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And HP is parallel to TW, for each of them is at right angles to the plane BD; [[XI. 6](/principles/euclid-11-6)] and TH is parallel to PX, for each of them is at right angles to the plane BF. [id.]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"HP与TW平行,每辆直角至平面 BD;TH与PX平行,每辆直角至平面 BF。 [[XI. 6](/principles/euclid-11-6)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-13-17.proof.13","contentId":"euclid-13-17","revisionId":"euclid-13-17@raw-c07f2b66e7ce3389","order":16,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 13","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"b80e8ea3429d2d5971860f2d84646ee66e2c0199c10b37e9e2662aed3d126b57","citations":["euclid-6-32"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But if two triangles, as XPH, HTW, which have two sides proportional to two sides be placed together at one angle so that their corresponding sides are also parallel, the remaining straight lines will be in a straight line; [[VI. 32](/principles/euclid-6-32)] therefore XH is in a straight line with HW."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但是,如果将两个三角,即XPH,HTW,两边成比例对两方的三角以一个角度排列,以便它们对应的两边也平行,则其余的直线将划成一条直线;因此,XH直线与HW直线。 [[VI. 32](/principles/euclid-6-32)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-13-17.proof.14","contentId":"euclid-13-17","revisionId":"euclid-13-17@raw-c07f2b66e7ce3389","order":17,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 14","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"a939f608fb1f253893933121bf075cd86f02fc7e08c4eb70969f83214e9f8c4f","citations":["euclid-11-1"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But every straight line is in one plane; [[XI. 1](/principles/euclid-11-1)] therefore the pentagon UBWCV is in one plane."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但每条直线都位于平面, 因此五角形UBWCV位于平面。 [[XI. 1](/principles/euclid-11-1)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-13-17.proof.15","contentId":"euclid-13-17","revisionId":"euclid-13-17@raw-c07f2b66e7ce3389","order":18,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 15","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"aff5930db734ec5c20ca44a9f9dc8e5a0d9500bfd5fb27e77abd4865b141557c","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"I say next that it is also equiangular."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"我接下来说,它也是角形的。"}]},{"id":"euclid-13-17.proof.16","contentId":"euclid-13-17","revisionId":"euclid-13-17@raw-c07f2b66e7ce3389","order":19,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 16","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"142344363394c5675d2f8b00701e7aa2f341db4f9fec36d2f4e2188b80f36cc5","citations":["euclid-13-5","euclid-13-4"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For, since the straight line NP has been cut in extreme and mean ratio at R, and PR is the greater segment, while PR is equal to PS, therefore NS has also been cut in extreme and mean ratio at P, and NP is the greater segment; [[XIII. 5](/principles/euclid-13-5)] therefore the squares on NS, SP are triple of the square on NP. [[XIII. 4](/principles/euclid-13-4)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因为,由于直线NP线在黄金分割被削减,为R,为PR,为PR,为PS,因此,NS也被削减,为黄金分割,为P,为NP,为NP,为正方形,为NS,为正方形,为NP,为336号,为正方形,为330号的三倍。（相关点与线段：SP） [[XIII. 5](/principles/euclid-13-5)] [[XIII. 4](/principles/euclid-13-4)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-13-17.proof.17","contentId":"euclid-13-17","revisionId":"euclid-13-17@raw-c07f2b66e7ce3389","order":20,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 17","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"ce50eeab9c778e4452ac44f001670672ddd5e4d0d2de708d1a427f63f97324c8","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But NP is equal to NB, and PS to SV; therefore the squares on NS, SV are triple of the square on NB; hence the squares on VS, SN, NB are quadruple of the square on NB."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但NP等于NB,PS至SV;因此,NS的正方形是NB的正方形的三倍;VS的正方形是SN,NB是NB的正方形的三倍。"}]},{"id":"euclid-13-17.proof.18","contentId":"euclid-13-17","revisionId":"euclid-13-17@raw-c07f2b66e7ce3389","order":21,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 18","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"286e9eb2174095e7b7e57edfafa96cb14b9bda835948a689415fb8d217853476","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But the square on SB is equal to the squares on SN, NB; therefore the squares on BS, SV, that is, the square on BV —for the angle VSB is right—is quadruple of the square on NB; therefore VB is double of BN."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但是,SB比正方形等于SN比正方形,NB,SB比正方形,SV,即BV比正方形比VSB比正方形等于432,VB比BN翻了两番。（相关点与线段：BS）"}]},{"id":"euclid-13-17.proof.19","contentId":"euclid-13-17","revisionId":"euclid-13-17@raw-c07f2b66e7ce3389","order":22,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 19","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"e37367934bc655545ae499fa1ee85a32d35b490253a4383ab3d2979933a43ad7","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But BC is also double of BN; therefore BV is equal to BC."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但BC也是BN的两倍,因此BV等于BC。"}]},{"id":"euclid-13-17.proof.20","contentId":"euclid-13-17","revisionId":"euclid-13-17@raw-c07f2b66e7ce3389","order":23,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 20","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"636a776a23d8469b9da3b0da0a33182a7322a416494d99ed3b4c9e221c976b72","citations":["euclid-1-8"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And, since the two sides BU, UV are equal to the two sides BW, WC, and the base BV is equal to the base BC, therefore the angle BUV is equal to the angle BWC. [[I. 8](/principles/euclid-1-8)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"由于双方BU,UV等于双方BW,WC,底边,BV等于底边,BC,因此,角度BUV等于角度BWC。 [[I. 8](/principles/euclid-1-8)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-13-17.proof.21","contentId":"euclid-13-17","revisionId":"euclid-13-17@raw-c07f2b66e7ce3389","order":24,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 21","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"912bbbbf8801442678d71e475e5972002a528ef39e2604fc8bcdc3686fa1d813","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Similarly we can prove that the angle UVC is also equal to the angle BWC; therefore the three angles BWC, BUV, UVC are equal to one another."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"同样,我们可以证明,UVC角也等于BWC角;因此,三个角度BWC、BUV、UVC角是彼此相等的。"}]},{"id":"euclid-13-17.proof.22","contentId":"euclid-13-17","revisionId":"euclid-13-17@raw-c07f2b66e7ce3389","order":25,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 22","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"d9e38a9fba2e7ef33f9085a975f8d1902e0456327ab5dd4e93b97f2c6295d573","citations":["euclid-13-7"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But if in an equilateral pentagon three angles are equal to one another, the pentagon will be equiangular, [[XIII. 7](/principles/euclid-13-7)] therefore the pentagon BUVCW is equiangular."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但是如果在等边形的五角形中,三个角度是等角的,那么五角形的BUVCW是等角的。 [[XIII. 7](/principles/euclid-13-7)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-13-17.proof.23","contentId":"euclid-13-17","revisionId":"euclid-13-17@raw-c07f2b66e7ce3389","order":26,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 23","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"fb4eb9895d40221bc0855c16ab5c0331e149512e0c32cc5be44c6e8e518c2861","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And it was also proved equilateral; therefore the pentagon BUVCW is equilateral and equiangular, and it is on one side BC of the cube."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"也证明是等边的, 因此五角形BUVCW是等边的和等角的, 它在立方体的一面是BC。"}]},{"id":"euclid-13-17.proof.24","contentId":"euclid-13-17","revisionId":"euclid-13-17@raw-c07f2b66e7ce3389","order":27,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 24","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"3f5eac5ed7cc0f8c68c12badc6f90a4b96bfb238e815bb16500c1e54886337a5","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore, if we make the same construction in the case of each of the twelve sides of the cube, a solid figure will have been constructed which is contained by twelve equilateral and equiangular pentagons, and which is called a dodecahedron."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,如果我们在立方体的12面的每一面都进行同样的构造,那么一个固态的图象就会被建造成由12个等边和角形的五角形构成,它被称为十面形。"}]},{"id":"euclid-13-17.proof.25","contentId":"euclid-13-17","revisionId":"euclid-13-17@raw-c07f2b66e7ce3389","order":28,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 25","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"e949b01d8f57d554d9c2404769f6189d8bfcb89e2d2316a5eb7b8e0c049ddcba","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"It is then required to comprehend it in the given sphere, and to prove that the side of the dodecahedron is the irrational straight line called apotome."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"然后,它必须理解它,在特定领域,并证明十二面体的一面是无理线段,称为截差无理线段。"}]},{"id":"euclid-13-17.construction.4","contentId":"euclid-13-17","revisionId":"euclid-13-17@raw-c07f2b66e7ce3389","order":29,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"942788274f85edb24f1dba37a907f1e1aa6969f8f6b375134eb3f50fb51fbadf","citations":["euclid-11-38"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For let XP be produced, and let the produced straight line be XZ; therefore PZ meets the diameter of the cube, and they bisect one another, for this has been proved in the last theorem but one of the eleventh book. [[XI. 38](/principles/euclid-11-38)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"延长XP,延长的直线为XZ;因此,PZ方块的直径相互相交,它们相互相交,因为这一点在最后的理论中已经证明,但第十一本书中只有一本。 [[XI. 38](/principles/euclid-11-38)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-13-17.construction.5","contentId":"euclid-13-17","revisionId":"euclid-13-17@raw-c07f2b66e7ce3389","order":30,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 5","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"d4e19e29f3a3f833eeddfd4fa972a019c01d5ed61c93c8a6feb4bf54420e1dd8","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let them cut at Z; therefore Z is the centre of the sphere which comprehends the cube, and ZP is half of the side of the cube."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"让它们在Z时切开,Z是球体的中心 球体中包含立方体,ZP是立方体的半边。"}]},{"id":"euclid-13-17.construction.6","contentId":"euclid-13-17","revisionId":"euclid-13-17@raw-c07f2b66e7ce3389","order":31,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 6","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"ae7df53abb15d15f3e412885e0a2a3200a4b27114351e06bb8557aa31af13912","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let UZ be joined."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"让UZ连接。"}]},{"id":"euclid-13-17.proof.26","contentId":"euclid-13-17","revisionId":"euclid-13-17@raw-c07f2b66e7ce3389","order":32,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 26","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"933c2eea4019a2583c654aac7b134d5127499b4ac9a4541f6f4cb2d73e5492ca","citations":["euclid-13-4"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Now, since the straight line NS has been cut in extreme and mean ratio at P, and NP is its greater segment, therefore the squares on NS, SP are triple of the square on NP. [[XIII. 4](/principles/euclid-13-4)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"现在,由于NS线的直线在黄金分割线P线被削减,NP线是其较大的部分,因此,NS线的正方形是NP线的三倍,SP线是正方形的三倍。 [[XIII. 4](/principles/euclid-13-4)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-13-17.proof.27","contentId":"euclid-13-17","revisionId":"euclid-13-17@raw-c07f2b66e7ce3389","order":33,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 27","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"ad99b02f59082d7e961d9a97e11f0c5fdd479ba279cddffac18f4ae12c7a0e1f","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But NS is equal to XZ, inasmuch as NP is also equal to PZ, and XP to PS."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但NS等于XZ,NP也等于PZ,XP至PS。"}]},{"id":"euclid-13-17.proof.28","contentId":"euclid-13-17","revisionId":"euclid-13-17@raw-c07f2b66e7ce3389","order":34,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 28","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"2bd70107a00e8d403ee3a65cd0d22877403981376284c01ca2283b24bd65d374","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But further PS is also equal to XU, since it is also equal to RP; therefore the squares on ZX, XU are triple of the square on NP."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但还有PS也等于XU,因为也等于RP;因此,ZX中的正方形,XU是NP中的3倍。"}]},{"id":"euclid-13-17.proof.29","contentId":"euclid-13-17","revisionId":"euclid-13-17@raw-c07f2b66e7ce3389","order":35,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 29","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"c185c2efd9949cd151b4a56f86e1ba7b61ec5e153961eda3cd42e5cf1f65cac2","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But the square on UZ is equal to the squares on ZX, XU; therefore the square on UZ is triple of the square on NP."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但UZ的正方形等于ZX的正方形,XU,因此,UZ的正方形等于NP的正方形的三倍。"}]},{"id":"euclid-13-17.proof.30","contentId":"euclid-13-17","revisionId":"euclid-13-17@raw-c07f2b66e7ce3389","order":36,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 30","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"286ecd70f75d7e6029a6d2c04bd8beba209f7632b4af83e03d6b62eed322d713","citations":["euclid-13-15"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But the square on the radius of the sphere which comprehends the cube is also triple of the square on the half of the side of the cube, for it has previously been shown how to construct a cube and comprehend it in a sphere, and to prove that the square on the diameter of the sphere is triple of the square on the side of the cube. [[XIII. 15](/principles/euclid-13-15)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但是,在球的半径上, 囊括立方体的正方形 也是立方体半边的正方形 的三倍, 因为以前已经证明它如何构造立方体, 并把它理解在一个球中, 并证明球的直径是 立方体的正方形 的三倍。 [[XIII. 15](/principles/euclid-13-15)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-13-17.proof.31","contentId":"euclid-13-17","revisionId":"euclid-13-17@raw-c07f2b66e7ce3389","order":37,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 31","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"4ea342a25c595837d34cf046f61fe25e6a45209bda4ac5d5c388b7a3ddfd93cd","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But, if whole is so related to whole, so is half to half also; and NP is half of the side of the cube; therefore UZ is equal to the radius of the sphere which comprehends the cube."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但是,如果整个与整体如此相关,那么半到半也是;NP是立方体的另一边;因此,UZ等于囊括立方体的球体半径。"}]},{"id":"euclid-13-17.proof.32","contentId":"euclid-13-17","revisionId":"euclid-13-17@raw-c07f2b66e7ce3389","order":38,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 32","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"7a7ac5e07848ffbbdce8d312ee9c5dbf091a7c4a5a68fffd5f49ccf9556d19a1","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And Z is the centre of the sphere which comprehends the cube; therefore the point U is on the surface of the sphere."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"Z是球体的中心 它可以理解立方体, 因此,U点在球体表面。"}]},{"id":"euclid-13-17.proof.33","contentId":"euclid-13-17","revisionId":"euclid-13-17@raw-c07f2b66e7ce3389","order":39,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 33","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"c249978ff722b5560034caca24d7fbb6613544c42baef30c6741e719a0516df5","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Similarly we can prove that each of the remaining angles of the dodecahedron is also on the surface of the sphere; therefore the dodecahedron has been comprehended in the given sphere."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"同样,我们可以证明,十二面体的每一个剩余角度也位于球体表面;因此,十二面体已在特定领域得到理解。"}]},{"id":"euclid-13-17.proof.34","contentId":"euclid-13-17","revisionId":"euclid-13-17@raw-c07f2b66e7ce3389","order":40,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 34","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"d1cfe89155e681565c327c5376b38093b9ebfa2f85b9984dd7cfccfd72e29094","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"I say next that the side of the dodecahedron is the irrational straight line called apotome."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"接下来我说,十二面体的一面是无理线段,叫做截差无理线段。"}]},{"id":"euclid-13-17.proof.35","contentId":"euclid-13-17","revisionId":"euclid-13-17@raw-c07f2b66e7ce3389","order":41,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 35","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"3e72d79ec67e31333ac6b804c6c2f7f068b490efb7fd9e5eee26d01bd2db9060","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For since, when NP has been cut in extreme and mean ratio, RP is the greater segment, and, when PO has been cut in extreme and mean ratio, PS is the greater segment, therefore, when the whole NO is cut in extreme and mean ratio, RS is the greater segment."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"由于在黄金分割削减NP次,RP次是较大的数量部分,而在黄金分割削减PO次,PS次是较大的数量部分,因此,当整个NO次削减黄金分割次时,RS次是较大的数量部分。"}]},{"id":"euclid-13-17.proof.36","contentId":"euclid-13-17","revisionId":"euclid-13-17@raw-c07f2b66e7ce3389","order":42,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 36","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"af7a426057cb5568297759e627fcab527df410a184992063e2a75a32c4ac9e22","citations":["euclid-5-15"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"[Thus, since, as NP is to PR, so is PR to RN, the same is true of the doubles also, for parts have the same ratio as their equimultiples; [[V. 15](/principles/euclid-5-15)] therefore as NO is to RS, so is RS to the sum of NR, SO."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"由于 NP 与 PR 之比等于 PR 与 RN 之比，把各量同时加倍后比例关系仍然成立，因为各量之比等于它们相应同倍数量之比；因此，NO 与 RS 之比等于 RS 与 NR、SO 之和的比。 [[V. 15](/principles/euclid-5-15)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-13-17.proof.37","contentId":"euclid-13-17","revisionId":"euclid-13-17@raw-c07f2b66e7ce3389","order":43,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 37","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"1a39a6c1fc830ccf747c23cbf2313fbb471fd9f5b5926e7b5acfe669bfaf2ee5","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But NO is greater than RS; therefore RS is also greater than the sum of NR, SO; therefore NO has been cut in extreme and mean ratio, and RS is its greater segment.]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但NO项超过RS项;因此,RS项也大于NR、SO项;因此,黄金分割项削减了NO项,RS项是其较大部分。 ]"}]},{"id":"euclid-13-17.proof.38","contentId":"euclid-13-17","revisionId":"euclid-13-17@raw-c07f2b66e7ce3389","order":44,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 38","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"59db7314abd03119818f74ac492ca34c392051516e68eb5755c0353b61d665bf","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But RS is equal to UV; therefore, when NO is cut in extreme and mean ratio, UV is the greater segment."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但RS等于UV;因此,当黄金分割削减NO时,UV是较大的数量部分。"}]},{"id":"euclid-13-17.proof.39","contentId":"euclid-13-17","revisionId":"euclid-13-17@raw-c07f2b66e7ce3389","order":45,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 39","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"5fbb5bcc5cfa8c47731c7c554a772006f07f0b52274638e4e4265d11c70eb157","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And, since the diameter of the sphere is rational, and the square on it is triple of the square on the side of the cube, therefore NO, being a side of the cube, is rational."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"球的直径是有理, 球上的正方形是立方体侧正方形的三倍, 所以NO,是立方体的边,是有理。"}]},{"id":"euclid-13-17.proof.40","contentId":"euclid-13-17","revisionId":"euclid-13-17@raw-c07f2b66e7ce3389","order":46,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 40","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"b72dca637cd27f2cb8820f5a7648dbb585a85c5c19176146fe29f0c17e39960f","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"[But if a rational line be cut in extreme and mean ratio, each of the segments is an irrational apotome.]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"[但如果在黄金分割削减有理线,则每个段段为无理 截差无理线段]"}]},{"id":"euclid-13-17.proof.41","contentId":"euclid-13-17","revisionId":"euclid-13-17@raw-c07f2b66e7ce3389","order":47,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 41","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"0aa278a0fae18b4b7f3f21f06ec7a81075d718cb6ba7971b0f108a69ffc8f18c","citations":["euclid-13-6"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore UV, being a side of the dodecahedron, is an irrational apotome. [[XIII. 6](/principles/euclid-13-6)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,UV是十二面体的一面,是无理 截差无理线段。 [[XIII. 6](/principles/euclid-13-6)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-13-17.conclusion","contentId":"euclid-13-17","revisionId":"euclid-13-17@raw-c07f2b66e7ce3389","order":48,"kind":"conclusion","title":"结论","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"b301bff10ecdb4443e3854847c5d7ad46f1dc2189a2fc37abb24fde8488b1015","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Porism. From this it is manifest that, when the side of the cube is cut in extreme and mean ratio, the greater segment is the side of the dodecahedron. Q. E. D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"质谱。 从这一点可以看出, 当立方体的侧面在黄金分割时切割, 较大的数量部分是十二面体的侧面。 证毕。"}]},{"id":"euclid-13-17.source","contentId":"euclid-13-17","revisionId":"euclid-13-17@raw-c07f2b66e7ce3389","order":49,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"f58fb850a58328d7ce11c153814eefdbb234116ffe696290a1d34c689fd97375","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"provenance","role":"provenance_note","language":"en","status":"generated_metadata","text":"Perseus / Heath source: https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:13.prop.17/\nCorpus URN: urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:13.prop.17\nCorpus SHA-256: ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c\nLicense: CC BY-SA 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/)"}]}],"outgoingEdges":[{"id":"edge:euclid-13-17:euclid-13-4:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-13-17","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-13-17.proof.2","euclid-13-17.proof.16","euclid-13-17.proof.26"],"targetContentId":"euclid-13-4","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg179